WEBVTT

00:00.267 --> 00:03.050
Tomorrow... will you remember her?

00:04.333 --> 00:07.250
The world forgot your sister. You will not.

00:08.467 --> 00:12.150
Follow forgotten roads.
Find the light they left behind.

00:14.567 --> 00:16.350
Fight for every memory.

00:20.467 --> 00:23.950
Shape your strength.
Uncover what the dawn erased.

00:31.400 --> 00:33.950
And decide what the next dawn will cost.

00:35.667 --> 00:38.050
Eldervale. The Hollow Sun.
